### Lab06 – Cryptographic Failures (MD5 lozinke + AES/ECB kartice)
@host = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Registracija kupca
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "testko", "password": "Lozinka123!"}

### 2. Prijava kupca
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "testko", "password": "Lozinka123!"}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: procurjeli "dump" lozinki (bez autentikacije)
# Ranjivo (main): MD5 heksevi; ivan i maja (ista lozinka 123456) imaju ISTI hash.
# Hasheve ubaci u CrackStation ili: hashcat -m 0 hashes.txt wordlists/top-100.txt
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/customers/export

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA (ECB): isti broj kartice -> isti ciphertext
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardNumber": "4111111111111111"}

### 5. Ponovi isti broj – usporedi ciphertext s korakom 4
# Ranjivo (main): identican ciphertext (ECB). Popravljeno: razlicit (AES-GCM, nasumicni IV).
POST {{host}}/api/lab06/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardNumber": "4111111111111111"}

### 6. Popis sifriranih kartica
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/cards

### 7. Maskirani prikaz (zamijeni 1 stvarnim id-om)
GET {{host}}/api/lab06/cards/1/masked
